# scripts/opcount: `level bench popcount N` counts the one bits of N words;
# the cost of one word is the slope between the two sizes (U3 CPU-LEVEL).
# Count it at GOAMD64=v1 and at GOAMD64=v3.
unit word
sizes 4096000 24576000
args bench popcount {n}
control benchmarks/level/testdata/control
binary level
